OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen lashes south-west
OL,4,AEngland and the Channel Islands
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office has issued an amber
OL,7,Fweather warning for strong winds for
OL,8,FCornwall and parts of Devon, and there
OL,9,Fis a red warning in place for Guernsey
OL,10,Fand Jersey as Storm Austen sweeps
OL,11,Facross parts of the UK.
OL,13,FAll schools in Jersey have been told to
OL,14,Fclose on Friday by the Government of
OL,15,FJersey.
OL,17,FA number of Cornwall schools are also
OL,18,Fclosed or opening late.
OL,20,FGusts of up to 80mph are set to hit the
OL,21,FSouth West and the Channel Islands.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
